# images.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester, against
# fl-engine's frame through emblema (docs/m3-images-text.md §9). Percent of
# pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Most cells differ by a few levels: JPEG decoded by zune-jpeg, not
# libjpeg-turbo (the photo, its crop, the resized copy), linear sampling's
# rounding (the checker at low and medium), the translucent stripes'
# blend. Over 32: the checker at none, whose 17.5-pixel texels put square
# edges on pixel centers; the checker at high, emblema's Mitchell cubic
# against Skia's; the photo crop's nearest texels. Measured 2026-10-29,
# lavapipe: 10.411% differ, 0.235% by more than 32.
differ 12.0
differ_over_32 0.4
